==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|talks over|talking over|talked over}}

# To [[discuss]]; to [[converse]] about a matter or issue.
#: ''Come home early, we have a lot to '''talk over'''.''
# To [[persuade]] (someone); to [[talk around]].
#: ''I didn't like the idea at first, but they eventually '''talked''' me '''over'''.''
# To verbally interrupt (someone); to speak at the same time as someone else.
#: ''She rudely '''talked over''' her opponent in the debate.''

